\newlabel{fig:spectral-signature}{{3.9}{18}{Median per-band digital number, normalized by each sensor's own overall band mean (1.0 = that sensor's average). Sentinel-2B and simulated $\Phi $-sat-2 overlap almost exactly; real $\Phi $-sat-2 has a markedly different spectral shape, peaking at Red and dipping at RE1 and NIR}{figure.caption.13}{}}
